{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-13-5","kind":"proposition","title":"等量关系：黄金分割与比例与线段","englishTitle":"If a straight line be cut in extreme and mean ratio, and there be added to it a straight line equal to the greater segment, the whole straight line has been cut in extreme and mean ratio, and the original straight line is the greater segment.","book":13,"number":5,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.5","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.5/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":5,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-13-5@raw-b840b4e3181dbdad","contentId":"euclid-13-5","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b840b4e3181dbdad53a27398f773aeda37ab8c938470000d9ccd1c7dc0b66c51","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-13-5.statement","euclid-13-5.construction.1","euclid-13-5.proof.1","euclid-13-5.construction.2","euclid-13-5.proof.2","euclid-13-5.proof.3","euclid-13-5.proof.4","euclid-13-5.proof.5","euclid-13-5.proof.6","euclid-13-5.proof.7","euclid-13-5.proof.8","euclid-13-5.conclusion","euclid-13-5.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-13-5.statement","contentId":"euclid-13-5","revisionId":"euclid-13-5@raw-b840b4e3181dbdad","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1c2ba6b1974b78d78960e6a405bc5ae5307e9ed398f86a3f175650a42a4a5ad7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If a straight line be cut in extreme and mean ratio, and there be added to it a straight line equal to the greater segment, the whole straight line has been cut in extreme and mean ratio, and the original straight line is the greater segment."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果在黄金分割削减一条直线,并在该直线中增加一条等于较大数量部分的直线,则整个直线在黄金分割削减,而原来的直线是较大的数量部分。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-5.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-13-5","revisionId":"euclid-13-5@raw-b840b4e3181dbdad","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8c0ac700fdd1c713248e2d9a423b072d31c01ef842bb5c1d8d1354dd7b7da232","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the straight line AB be cut in extreme and mean ratio at the point C, let AC be the greater segment, and let AD be equal to AC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AB线线在黄金分割线C点切开,AC线成为较大的数量部分,AD线等于AC线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-5.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-13-5","revisionId":"euclid-13-5@raw-b840b4e3181dbdad","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b55f5816468d5520470a616e0c4182a53af2a278607c9d2cd8642f8527305542","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say that the straight line DB has been cut in extreme and mean ratio at A, and the original straight line AB is the greater segment."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我说,直线 DB在黄金分割A时被削减,而直线 AB是较大的数量部分。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-5.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-13-5","revisionId":"euclid-13-5@raw-b840b4e3181dbdad","order":3,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d836fe467badd4c890ed4d08ab407cda4025128cd771c552bf487131f044f94e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the square AE be described on AB, and let the figure be drawn."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AE AE的描述在AB上,然后绘制数字。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-5.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-13-5","revisionId":"euclid-13-5@raw-b840b4e3181dbdad","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2bb5f7958d3322aaa449d49d1a0c68146b913560bb5f63d07e710569460e0b82","citations":["euclid-6-def-3"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since AB has been cut in extreme and mean ratio at C, therefore the rectangle AB, BC is equal to the square on AC. [[VI. Def. 3](/principles/euclid-6-def-3), VI. 17]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于黄金分割削减了AB, 时速为C, 时速为矩形, 时速为AB, 时速为BC, 时速为AC, 时速为VI. 17] [ [VI. Def. 3](/principles/euclid-6-def-3)"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-5.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-13-5","revisionId":"euclid-13-5@raw-b840b4e3181dbdad","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"34bc53ebcff4dd401176b0e0d988bdbce53bb4d38518f47c44843414176cc0e0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And CE is the rectangle AB, BC, and CH the square on AC; therefore CE is equal to HC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"CE是矩形 AB,BC,AC是CH,CE等于HC。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-5.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-13-5","revisionId":"euclid-13-5@raw-b840b4e3181dbdad","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"916fcbfe18768f3c0f24e9bcc558cd4feac41e37d943a5b2547d11f0ce0bb5f0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But HE is equal to CE, and DH is equal to HC; therefore DH is also equal to HE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但HE等于CE,DH等于HC,因此DH也等于HE。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-5.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-13-5","revisionId":"euclid-13-5@raw-b840b4e3181dbdad","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f6303d724260ead3873e1b7984c837c10c1819f2abe39484a335fca06bf3c23f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the whole DK is equal to the whole AE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,整个DK等于整个AE。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-5.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-13-5","revisionId":"euclid-13-5@raw-b840b4e3181dbdad","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"214117cf01a12e40601ddd2f119ceb42288c02db202a33d6471d72bcfe42140d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And DK is the rectangle BD, DA, for AD is equal to DL; and AE is the square on AB; therefore the rectangle BD, DA is equal to the square on AB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"DK是矩形 BD,DA,AD等于DL;AE是AB的正方形;因此,矩形 BD,DA等于AB的正方形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-5.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-13-5","revisionId":"euclid-13-5@raw-b840b4e3181dbdad","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c9a612ecebbf1bc1a0d184b08b99538f4ab83ebe5032efe2ec7cd96e8a784abb","citations":["euclid-6-17"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, as DB is to BA, so is BA to AD. [[VI. 17](/principles/euclid-6-17)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,DB对BA的比等于BA对AD的比；DB 与 BA 之比等于 BA 与 AD 之比。 [[VI. 17](/principles/euclid-6-17)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-5.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-13-5","revisionId":"euclid-13-5@raw-b840b4e3181dbdad","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"091ee4af2a94f7a3d8c043cd16e1d2c74ac6d408728ea939fcd42de8d42920a6","citations":["euclid-5-14"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And DB is greater than BA; therefore BA is also greater than AD. [[V. 14](/principles/euclid-5-14)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"DB比BA强,BA也大于AD。 [[V. 14](/principles/euclid-5-14)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-5.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-13-5","revisionId":"euclid-13-5@raw-b840b4e3181dbdad","order":11,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b9485f5bcdfa591bacdc9067393c578f462bbd30ca3b50ee07a043ad3ff134fc","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore DB has been cut in extreme and mean ratio at A, and AB is the greater segment. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,黄金分割削减了DB,为A,AB是较大的数量部分。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-5.source","contentId":"euclid-13-5","revisionId":"euclid-13-5@raw-b840b4e3181dbdad","order":12,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b49ef4e4e898875a08d496f9436c5f859632dad64f6301f3c44aad37fdb5545e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.5/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.5\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-13-5:euclid-6-def-3:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-13-5","sourceBlockIds":["euclid